{"seq":2,"slug":"uav-system-design","title":"无人机系统设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals/uav-system-design","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"无人机系统设计\">无人机系统设计</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>无人机系统（UAS, Unmanned Aircraft System）设计是一项从任务需求出发、经过总体参数确定、各分系统选型与集成、最终通过试飞验证的系统工程。与传统载人飞机设计相比，无人机设计更强调任务载荷比、自主能力和快速迭代。</p>\n<h3 id=\"总体设计方法论\">总体设计方法论</h3><p>无人机总体设计遵循&quot;需求牵引→概念设计→初步设计→详细设计&quot;的螺旋递进过程：</p>\n<p><strong>需求分析与约束建立</strong></p>\n<p>设计始于对任务剖面（mission profile）的精确定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任务类型：侦察/运输/植保/巡检</li>\n<li>有效载荷质量与体积约束</li>\n<li>航程/航时要求</li>\n<li>飞行包线（速度范围、高度范围、机动能力）</li>\n<li>环境条件（温度、风速、海拔）</li>\n<li>成本与产量目标</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>重量估算迭代</strong></p>\n<p>总体设计的核心是重量闭环。起飞重量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由以下关系确定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0 = W_{payload} + W_{structure} + W_{propulsion} + W_{avionics} + W_{energy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><spa