rgin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{battery}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电池能量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{bat}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为比能量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 为放电效率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结构设计与载荷分析\">结构设计与载荷分析</h3><p>无人机结构设计以轻量化为首要目标，同时满足强度和刚度要求。</p>\n<p><strong>材料选择</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>比强度</th>\n<th>比刚度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳纤维复合材料</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>机架、桨叶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铝合金（7075-T6）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>结构连接件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程塑料（PA/PC）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>外壳、起落架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钛合金</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>关键承力件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>载荷工况</strong></p>\n<p>设计载荷需考虑以下典型工况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>悬停：均匀载荷，最大弯矩在机臂根部</li>\n<li>急停机动：惯性过载 2-3g</li>\n<li>单发失效：不对称载荷</li>\n<li>着陆冲击：过载 5-10g（取决于起落架形式）</li>\n<li>运输与跌落：包装保护设计</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"适航性设计\">适航性设计</h3><p>2024年中国民航局发布《民用无人驾驶航空器系统适航审定管理办法》，对25kg以上运输类无人机和载人eVTOL提出适航要求。适航性设计需要在总体设计阶段就嵌入以下理念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>失效安全（Fail-Safe）</strong>：任何单一失效不导致灾难性后果</li>\n<li><strong>损伤容限</strong>：结构在存在可检损伤的情况下仍满足强度要求</li>\n<li><strong>系统安全性评估</strong>：基于 ARP4761 方法论，进行功能危害评估（FHA）和故障树分析（FTA）</li>\n<li><strong>持续适航</strong>：定义检查间隔、维护大纲和寿命限制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>拓扑优化结构</strong>：基于增材制造（3D打印）的拓扑优化机架，小鹏汇天飞行汽车减重 30% 同时提升刚度</li>\n<li><strong>固态电池上机</strong>：宁德时代2025年发布航空级固态电池，能量密度达 500 Wh/kg，使大型eVTOL续航突破 200 km</li>\n<li><strong>氢电混合动力</strong>：斗山创新在韩国完成氢燃料电池无人机 12 小时连续飞行验证</li>\n<li><strong>模块化快换设计</strong>：大疆 FlyCart 30 采用快换电池+快换载荷舱设计，换电时间 &lt; 60 秒</li>\n<li><strong>数字线程（Digital Thread）</strong>：从设计→制造→运维全生命周期数据贯通，航空工业集团在&quot;翼龙&quot;系列上全面推行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一架最大起飞重量 5 kg 的四旋翼巡检无人机（有效载荷 1 kg、航时 ≥ 30 min）。确定电池容量、电机 KV 值和螺旋桨规格的初步选型方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比分析碳纤维机架与铝合金机架在抗坠毁性能方面的差异。碳纤维的脆性断裂特征对无人机安全设计意味着什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某六旋翼无人机设计为允许任意一台电机失效后仍可安全降落。计算单发失效时的姿态控制裕度和最大允许载荷。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>调研中国民航局无人机适航审定框架，比较&quot;设计批准函&quot;和&quot;型号合格证&quot;的适用范围和审定要求差异。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>无人机系统设计是约束驱动的优化问题——在有限的重量预算内平衡续航、载荷、可靠性和成本。掌握总体参数估算方法、动力系统匹配逻辑、结构轻量化技术和适航设计理念，能够形成从需求到方案的完整设计链路。随着适航法规体系完善和新能源技术突破，无人机系统设计正从&quot;能飞就行&quot;向&quot;安全可靠可认证&quot;的工业级标准演进。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无人机系统设计","id":"无人机系统设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"总体设计方法论","id":"总体设计方法论"},{"level":3,"text":"动力系统选型","id":"动力系统选型"},{"level":3,"text":"结构设计与载荷分析","id":"结构设计与载荷分析"},{"level":3,"text":"适航性设计","id":"适航性设计"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"低空空气动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals/aerodynamics-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"eVTOL技术与城市空中交通","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals/evtol-technology"}}